---
import Term from './Term.astro'
interface Props { lang: 'zh' | 'en'; headingLevel?: 2 | 3 }
const { lang, headingLevel = 2 } = Astro.props
const H = `h${headingLevel}`
---
<section class="safety" aria-labelledby={`safety-${lang}`}>
  <H id={`safety-${lang}`}>{lang === 'zh' ? '先读：安全须知' : 'Read first: safety'}</H>
  {lang === 'zh' ? (
    <ul>
      <li>本书向公共网络发出的交易，只发生在 Ethereum <Term id="sepolia">Sepolia</Term> 测试网。测试网是练习用的链，测试币可免费领取、没有市场价值；网络编号 <Term id="chainid">chainId</Term> 是 11155111。本书从未使用<Term id="mainnet">主网</Term>。第 17–19 章的写入只在本机 Anvil（chainId 31337）：有的先只读复制 Sepolia 历史状态，有的完全自建。那些本地哈希不能到 Sepolia 浏览器里查。</li>
      <li>Phase-0 入门实验<strong>预算为 0 美元</strong>：没有买币，没有花<span class="nw">一分真钱。</span></li>
      <li><Term id="sepeth">测试网 ETH（SepETH）</Term>和书中的<Term id="test-token">测试代币</Term><strong>没有市场价值</strong>，<span class="nw">也不是收益。</span></li>
      <li>本书<strong>不是投资建议</strong>，也不是第三方<span class="nw">安全<Term id="audit">审计</Term>证明。</span></li>
      <li><strong>永远不要</strong>把真实<Term id="wallet">钱包</Term>的<Term id="seed-phrase">助记词</Term>或<Term id="private-key">私钥</Term>（相当于钱包的总钥匙）导入任何实验环境、网页、聊天或<span class="nw">代码仓库。</span></li>
      <li>这是个人学习笔记，<strong>不是</strong> Ethereum、Etherscan 或任何公司的<span class="nw">官方产品。</span></li>
    </ul>
  ) : (
    <ul>
      <li>Public broadcasts in this book happened only on the Ethereum <Term id="sepolia">Sepolia</Term> testnet. A testnet is a practice chain. Its coins are free and have no market value. Its <Term id="chainid">chainId</Term> is 11155111. <Term id="mainnet">Mainnet</Term> was never used. Chapters 17 to 19 write only on a local Anvil node (chainId 31337). Some runs copy a historical Sepolia state first. One run builds every contract locally. Do not look up those local hashes on a Sepolia explorer.</li>
      <li>The Phase-0 starter labs had a <strong>$0 budget</strong>: no crypto was bought and no real money <span class="nw">was spent.</span></li>
      <li><Term id="sepeth">Test ETH (SepETH)</Term> and the <Term id="test-token">test tokens</Term> in this book have <strong>no market value</strong>. They are <span class="nw">not earnings.</span></li>
      <li>This book is <strong>not financial advice</strong> and not a third-party <span class="nw">security <Term id="audit">audit</Term>.</span></li>
      <li><strong>Never</strong> import a real <Term id="wallet">wallet</Term>'s <Term id="seed-phrase">seed phrase</Term> or <Term id="private-key">private key</Term> (the master key to a wallet) into any lab, website, chat, or <span class="nw">code repository.</span></li>
      <li>These are personal study notes, <strong>not</strong> an official product of Ethereum, Etherscan, or <span class="nw">any company.</span></li>
    </ul>
  )}
</section>
